# proto: everything ignored here is rebuilt byte-for-byte by `foundry build <face>`
# from the record that is kept — face.yaml, glyphs/manifest.csv, specimens/*.json, the decisions' logs —
# once the book is shelved (`foundry shelve <archive_id>`).
# Delete this file when the face goes to draft: from then on the UFO is edited by hand.
glyphs/*
!glyphs/manifest.csv
specimens/*.jpg
specimens/*.png
svg/potrace/
ufo/
dist/
proofs/
# what each build did, glyph by glyph: rewritten by every build. The decisions' logs (found, label, rename,
# fetch, survey, construct, and Arrow's cast/diff/frame) are kept.
log/build.json
log/cut.jsonl
log/sort.jsonl
log/justify.jsonl
log/matrix.jsonl
log/proof.jsonl
